s' at Tibbits Opera House\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15013\",\"d2\",376,734,\"owners: Dow Jones & Company\\nfounders: Charles Dow, Edward Jones, Charles Bergstresser\\nchiefeditor: Emma Tucker\\ndepeditor: Charles Forelle\\nmaneditor: Liz Harris\\nopeditor: Paul Gigot\\npublisher: Almar Latour\\nlanguage: English\\nheadquarters: 1211 Avenue of the Americas, New York City, New York 10036, U.S.\\npublishing_country: United States\\nstaff: 1, 800May 2025\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15012\",\"d2\",0,376,\"---\\ntitle: The Wall Street Journal - Wikipedia\\nauthor: Authority control databases National Germany France BnF data Sweden\\ndate: 2003-01-23\\n---\\nname: The Wall Street Journal\\nlogo: frameless|class=skin-invert|250px\\nlogo_border: yes\\nimage_size: 250px\\nimage_border: yes\\nimage_alt: border\\nmotto: It's Your Business\\ntype: Daily newspaper\\nformat: Broadsheet\\nfoundation: 8 July 1889\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15014\",\"d2\",734,1124,\"circulation: 3, 966, 000 news subscribers, * 3, 406, 000 digital-only, * 560, 000 print + digital\\ncirculation_date: June 2023\\ncirculation_ref: News Corporation 2023 the Annual Report on Form 10-K August 15, 2023 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission live April 27, 2024 PDF March 19, 2024\\nissn: 0099-9660\\neissn: 1042-9840\\noclc: 781541372\\n\\nname: OpinionJournal.com\\nurl: opinionjournal.com\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15015\",\"d2\",1124,1446,\"commercial: Yes\\ntype: News and opinion\\nlanguage: English\\nregistration: N/A\\nowner: The Wall Street Journal\\nauthor: The Wall Street Journal\\ncurrent_status: Redirects to wsj.com/news/opinion\\nrevenue: N/A\\n\\nThe Wall Street Journal (WSJ), also referred to simply as the Journal, is an American newspaper based in New York City. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15016\",\"d2\",1446,1731,\"The newspaper provides extensive coverage of news, especially business and finance. It operates on a subscription model, requiring readers to pay for access to most of its articles and content. The Journal is published six days a week by Dow Jones & Company, a division of News Corp.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15017\",\"d2\",1731,2093,\"As of 2023, The Wall Street Journal is the largest newspaper in the United States by print circulation, with 609,650 print subscribers. It has 3.17 million digital subscribers, the second-most in the nation after The New York Times. The newspaper is one of the United States' newspapers of record. The first issue of the newspaper was published on July 8, 1889. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15178\",\"d3\",0,382,\"---\\ntitle: History of WWE SmackDown - Wikipedia\\ndate: 2017-11-12\\n---\\nThe history of WWF/E SmackDown, began with the show's debut on August 26, 1999, in Kansas City, Missouri. The show was originally broadcast on Thursday nights but moved to Friday on September 9, 2005, before returning to Thursdays on January 15, 2015. On July 19, 2016, it was moved to Tuesday Nights. SmackDown! \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15179\",\"d3\",382,695,\"debuted in the United States on the UPN television network on April 29, 1999, but after the merger of UPN and the WB, SmackDown! began airing on The CW in September 2006. The show was moved to MyNetworkTV in October 2008, to Syfy on October 1, 2010 and to USA Network on January 7, 2016.\\n\\nIn its WWF/E SmackDown! \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15180\",\"d3\",695,998,\"history, SmackDown has been broadcast from more than 162 arenas, in more than 147 cities and towns, and in nine countries (the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, Iraq in 2003 and 2004 for Tribute to the Troops, Japan in 2005, Italy in 2007, Mexico in 2011, and France and Saudi Arabia in 2024). \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15181\",\"d3\",998,1364,\"Prior to switching to the current live format, taped episodes premiered a few hours earlier in Ireland and the United Kingdom and a day earlier in Australia, Canada, and Singapore than the United States, due to time differences. The show celebrated its 15th anniversary on October 10, 2014, and its 1,000th episode on October 16, 2018.\\n\\nOriginal format (1999–2001)\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15182\",\"d3\",1364,1712,\"The early set included an oval-shaped TitanTron entrance and stage (dubbed the \\\"Ovaltron\\\") which made it stand out from the Raw set with its rectangular Titantrons. Later productions gained the ability to move the Ovaltron either to the left or to the right of the stage. Throughout the show's early existence, The Rock routinely called SmackDown! \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15248\",\"d4\",252,614,\"JUNEAU, Alaska (AP) — The remains of all 10 people killed when their small plane crashed into ice on the Bering Sea have been recovered, authorities said.\\n\\nThe Nome Volunteer Fire Department made the announcement on its Facebook page Saturday afternoon. Recovery crews had been racing to recover the bodies before a winter storm was expected to hit the region.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15247\",\"d4\",0,252,\"---\\ntitle: The remains of all 10 people killed in Alaska plane crash have been recovered, authorities say\\nauthor: The Associated Press\\ndate: 2025-02-09\\n---\\nThe remains of all 10 people killed in Alaska plane crash have been recovered, authorities say\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15249\",\"d4\",614,991,\"\\\"All ten individuals aboard the Bering Air plane have been officially brought home,\\\" the fire department wrote in the social media post at about 3 p.m.\\n\\nCrews were still working on recovering the aircraft, the fire department said.\\n\\nThe Bering Air single-engine turboprop plane was traveling from Unalakleet to the hub community of Nome when it disappeared Thursday afternoon. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15250\",\"d4\",991,1160,\"It was found the next day after an extensive search with all nine passengers and the pilot dead, making it one of the deadliest plane crashes in the state in 25 years.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15251\",\"d4\",1160,1406,\"The aircraft is on an ice floe that is drifting about 5 miles (8 kilometers) a day, creating difficult conditions for recovery crews, said National Transportation Safety Board chair Jennifer Homendy during a press conference Saturday afternoon.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15252\",\"d4\",1406,1717,\"\\\"Please know that we'll work diligently to determine how this happened with the ultimate goal of improving safety in Alaska and across the United States,\\\" said Homendy.\\n\\nAs the community tried to process the deadly event, crews worked swiftly on unstable, slushy sea ice to recover the bodies and the wreckage. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15253\",\"d4\",1717,2001,\"The National Weather Service issued a winter weather advisory, with snow and winds up to 45 miles per hour (72 kilometers per hour) expected to hit the region Saturday night, lasting into Sunday evening.\\n\\nAmong those killed in the crash were Rhone Baumgartner and Kameron Hartvigson. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15267\",\"d5\",0,256,\"---\\ntitle: Jacek Malczewski exchibition at National Museum in Krakow\\ndate: 2022-07-08\\n---\\nThe exhibition will focus on three themes originating in Romantic traditions and will present more than 150 works by Malczewski from museum and private collections.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15268\",\"d5\",256,654,\"Jacek Malczewski is one of the most outstanding individuals of Polish art, one who occupies a special place in the creative output of the Young Poland period.\\n\\nNational Museum in Krakow\\n\\nTHE MAIN BUILDING\\n\\nAL. 3 MAJA 1\\n\\n24th Great Dragon Parade\\n\\n06-06-2025Join us for the 24th Great Dragon Parade – one of the most spectacular open-air events in Poland!\\n\\nCraft Fair on Kraków's Main Market Square\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15269\",\"d5\",654,1042,\"23-05-2025We invite you to the unique Craft Fair on the Main Market Square in Kraków, where tradition is brought to life through handmade crafts.\\n\\nAbakanowicz. No rules. Sculptures in Wawel's Gardens\\n\\n07-05-2025Od 24 kwietnia w renesansowym ogrodzie Zamku Królewskiego na Wawelu można oglądać 14 plenerowych rzeźb najwybitniejszej polskiej rzeźbiarki. see the website for more details: \\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15270\",\"d5\",1042,1398,\"Mastercard OFF CAMERA festival\\n\\n25-04-2025The 18th edition of the Mastercard OFF CAMERA International Festival of Independent Cinema starts today and will last until May 4, 2025.\\n\\nHappy Easter\\n\\n18-04-2025May this Easter be as bright and cheerful as a spring day! Best wishes from Antique Apartments Team\\n\\nEaster Market on the Main Market Square in Kraków\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15271\",\"d5\",1398,1723,\"10-04-2025Easter Market on the Main Market Square in Kraków will take place from April 10 to April 21. The festive atmosphere is enhanced by charming decorations and spring greenery, including Emaus trees – symbols of rebirth and a nod to old traditions.\\n\\nThe Art Collection of the Society of Friends of Fine Arts in Kraków\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14343\",\"d1\",1396,1743,\"COLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House wishes to extend its sincere appreciation to Frederick Family Dental of Coldwater for its sponsorship of Little Shop of Horrors as a part of this year's Summer Theatre series, as well as its sponsorship support of the theatre for the past several years. Frederick Family Dental began sponsoring Summer Theatre […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14344\",\"d1\",1743,1845,\"Tibbits Opera House Welcomes The McCartney Years, a Tribute to the Music of Paul McCartney and Wings\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14345\",\"d1\",1845,2229,\"COLDWATER – Fans of Paul McCartney, whether they enjoy his time with The Beatles, with Wings or his extensive solo career, are invited to come experience a night at the 'Rock Show,' as The McCartney Years, a tribute to the music of Paul McCartney and Wings, arrives at the historic Tibbits Opera House on Saturday, […]\\n\\nParrish Excavating Sponsors 'Act Three' at Tibbits Opera House\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14346\",\"d1\",22