LDWATER – Grab your deerstalker cap and get ready to laugh, as Tibbits Film Series hosts a screening of the 2019 film Pokémon: Detective Pikachu on Saturday, March 29, at the historic Tibbits Opera House. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14352\",\"d1\",4137,4517,\"Loosely based on the 2016 video game released for the Nintendo 3DS, Detective Pikachu takes place in a world where […]\\n\\nTibbits Opera House to Host 'Movies So Bad They Are Good' Series Featuring Cult Classic Films\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Film Series is set to host a series of films that can only be described as \\\"so bad they are good!\\\" on Tuesday evenings in March and early April. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14353\",\"d1\",4517,4732,\"Whether it's bad special effects, bad writing, bad acting or all of the above, people love bad movies. We especially love movies we […]\\n\\nTibbits Opera House Set to Host 2025 Comedy Fest with Headliner John Heffron\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14354\",\"d1\",4732,5084,\"COLDWATER – Escape the late winter blues and have some laughs as Tibbits is excited to welcome comedian and Detroit native John Heffron to headline Tibbits' annual Comedy Fest, Saturday, March 15 at 7pm at the historic Tibbits Opera House. Two other Michigan-based comedians, Melissa Hager and Gerrit Elzinga, will be appearing as well. Energetic […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14355\",\"d1\",5084,5141,\"Tibbits Opera House Unveils 2025 Popcorn Theatre Season\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14356\",\"d1\",5141,5518,\"COLDWATER – Tibbits Popcorn Theatre returns for its 38th season with family-friendly shows to fill Friday and Saturday mornings from June 6 through August 2, including three plays brought to life by Tibbits' professional Summer Theatre company members, a musical storybook from Kalamazoo Symphony Orchestra and the comedy magic of Jonathon LaChance. Popcorn Theatre kicks […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14357\",\"d1\",5518,5809,\"Tibbits Opera House to Host Exclusive Screening of 2025 Oscar Nominated Short Films\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Film Series is set to host an exclusive screening of the 2025 Academy Award-nominated animated and live-action short films on Saturday, February 15, at the historic Tibbits Opera House. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14358\",\"d1\",5809,6191,\"Tibbits is thrilled to bring this showcase to the Coldwater community, and offer a glimpse at these critically acclaimed short films. Film enthusiasts […]\\n\\nTibbits Annual Meeting Wrap-Up\\n\\nCOLDWATER –Tibbits Opera Foundation & Arts Council, Inc. held its annual meeting at the historic opera house on Thursday, January 23, immediately followed by the board's organizational meeting. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14359\",\"d1\",6191,6438,\"The theme that resonated through the evening was strength and adaptability. The Tibbits staff has grown, some roles have shifted, and it has worked to adapt to […]\\n\\nDon't miss 'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutant Mayhem' at Tibbits Opera House!\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14360\",\"d1\",6438,6793,\"A little bit of mayhem is on its way to Tibbits Opera House as the historic venue will screen Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutant Mayhem on Saturday, January 18, at 5pm, with a pizza party starting at 4pm. After years of being sheltered from the human world, the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles set out to […]\\n\\nTibbits Annual Meeting Slated for January 23\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14361\",\"d1\",6793,7132,\"COLDWATER – The annual meeting of the Tibbits Opera Foundation & Arts Council, Inc. will review the historic theatre's 2023-2024 fiscal year at 5:30 p.m. Thursday, January 23, 2025. \\\"The theatre's annual meeting gives us a chance to review the past year and show how we've been serving and engaging the community,\\\" said Tibbits Board […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14362\",\"d1\",7132,7449,\"Tibbits Opera House Welcomes Commotion: A Tribute to the Music of Creedence Clearwater Revival\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Get ready for a rocking, round-trip journey to the glory days of rock 'n' roll as Tibbits Opera House welcomes Commotion, a Tribute to the Music of Creedence Clearwater Revival, on Saturday, January 25, 2025! \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14363\",\"d1\",7449,7626,\"Featuring Steve McLain on lead vocals, with guitarist Jimmy Ryan, drummer Mark Ellis and bassist George Foster, Commotion […]\\n\\nTibbits Opera House Announces 2025 Summer Season\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14364\",\"d1\",7626,7979,\"COLDWATER – Whether a monstrous tale straight from Skid Row, a legendary Rock 'n' Roll jam session, spelling bee drama, or a story of love and laughter among old friends, the 62nd consecutive season of Tibbits Summer Theatre offers audiences a fun-filled mainstage season featuring three distinct musicals and a world-premiere play, along with the […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14365\",\"d1\",7979,8367,\"Tibbits Young Audiences to Hold Auditions for \\\"The Enchantment of Beauty & the Beast\\\"\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Young Audiences invites students in fourth through eighth grades to audition for the spring production of The Enchantment of Beauty & the Beast. Auditions will be held on January 6 and 7 at 5pm at Tibbits Opera House. We all love the story of the prince who is cursed to be a […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14366\",\"d1\",8367,8749,\"Tibbits' Summer Theatre is Nominated for 2024 BroadwayWorld Michigan Awards\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits 2024 Summer Theatre has been nominated for a variety of awards on \\\"BroadwayWorld,\\\" an online theatre news publication. The site hosts regional awards for productions across the globe, with winners decided by a popular vote. Votes can be cast at:  and voting will conclude on 12/31/24. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14367\",\"d1\",8749,9039,\"Tibbits Opera House was nominated […]\\n\\nTibbits Opera House Invites Artist Submissions for 'Opposites Attract' Gallery Show\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House invites artists of all ages and skill levels to submit their interpretation of the upcoming themed gallery show, \\\"Opposites Attract.\\\" \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14368\",\"d1\",9039,9267,\"This exhibition will explore things in this world that specifically attract each other due to the fact that they are opposites. Whether sweet and sour, yin and yang, ice cream […]\\n\\nArts Alive Announces 2025 Gallery Show Themes\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14369\",\"d1\",9267,9634,\"COLDWATER – From photography and paintings to sculptures and multimedia, from glitter to grunge, artists of all mediums are invited to enter their creative pieces in Arts Alive's upcoming gallery exhibits at Tibbits Opera House. Gallery shows for 2025 open for submissions by the public include \\\"Opposites Attract,\\\" \\\"Sunrise, Sunset,\\\" \\\"Bird is the Word,\\\" \\\"Kids' […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14370\",\"d1\",9634,9993,\"Tibbits Film Series Presents Die Hard!\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Whether or not you believe \\\"Die Hard\\\" is a Christmas movie, celebrate this iconic action film at Tibbits Opera House, December 20 at 6:30 pm, complete with a Nakatomi Christmas Party at 5:30 pm! Released in 1988, but set at Christmas time, \\\"Die Hard\\\" follows NYPD cop John McClane, who visits his wife […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14371\",\"d1\",9993,10282,\"Tibbits' 45th Annual Auction Takes a Time-Traveling Adventure with a \\\"Back to the Future\\\" Theme\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House is set to take guests on a thrilling journey back to the iconic 1980s with its 45th Annual Auction, themed \\\"Back to the Future,\\\" on Saturday, November 2, 2024. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14372\",\"d1\",10282,10681,\"This much-anticipated fundraising event is set to elevate the beloved tradition that has captivated audiences for the past 44 years, promising […]\\n\\nTibbits Young Audiences Presents \\\"Book Reports of Destiny\\\"\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Local students will showcase their creativity in Book Reports of Destiny at Tibbits Opera House on October 17 and 18 at 7 p.m., with a matinee performance on October 19 at 2 p.m. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14373\",\"d1\",10681,10937,\"This lively production transforms classroom book reports into an entertaining experience, captivating audiences with humor and imagination. The play's story […]\\n\\nA Classic Vampire Flick and Synth Punk Rock Make Tibbits 2024 Monster Fest a Must-See Event!\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14374\",\"d1\",10937,11306,\"COLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House will embrace the Halloween spirit with an unforgettable evening of live music and a cult classic film at Monster Fest 2024, on October 12. The event kicks off with a performance by the synth punk band Loser Candy at 8:30 p.m., followed by a screening of the 1986 vampire favorite […]\\n\\n\\\"Coldwater Kitchen\\\" Documentary Returns to Tibbits\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14375\",\"d1\",11306,11656,\"COLDWATER – Tibbits Film Series is bringing back the powerful documentary \\\"Coldwater Kitchen\\\" for a special screening on October 4, with showings at 4:00 PM and 7:00 PM. This acclaimed film offers an insightful look into Chef Jimmy Lee Hill's renowned culinary training program at Lakeland Prison in Coldwater, Michigan. For 30 years, Chef Hill […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14376\",\"d1\",11656,12015,\"TYA Celebrates the Impact of Flagstar Foundation Grant\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Young Audiences (TYA) program at Tibbits Opera House fulfilled the generous Flagstar Foundation grant awarded last year. This support highlights the foundation's commitment to enhancing creative opportunities for underserved communities, with a particular focus on arts and culture. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14377\",\"d1\",12015,12391,\"Allocated from September 1, 2023, through July 31, 2024, the grant supported the productions […]\\n\\nLyrical Baritone Gerald J. Case-Blanchard and Pianist Wendy Chu Featured at Smith Memorial Concert\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House is set to present the 23rd Smith Memorial Benefit Concert on September 21. This year's event will feature celebrated lyric baritone Dr. Gerald J. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14378\",\"d1\",12391,12778,\"Case-Blanchard and accomplished pianist Dr. Wendy Chu, both internationally acclaimed performers. Dr. Gerald J. Case-Blanchard, from Philadelphia, is renowned for his powerful voice and notable operatic […]\\n\\nTibbits Opera House to Stage Pulitzer Prize-Winning Play \\\"Proof\\\"\\n\\nTibbits Opera House is set to present David Auburn's acclaimed play, Proof, from September 6 to 8, and 12 to 14. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14379\",\"d1\",12778,13094,\"This Pulitzer Prize-winning drama, which originally premiered on Broadway in 2000, offers a profound exploration of the intersection between genius, mental health, and human connection. Proof follows Catherine, the daughter of a once-renowned mathematician […]\\n\\nGarth Brooks Tribute Band Takes the Stage at Tibbits\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14380\",\"d1\",13094,13447,\"COLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House will host Fresh Horses, a Garth Brooks tribute band on August 23. Produced by Moxie Events, this highly anticipated show will celebrate one of country music's most legendary figures. Leading the tribute is the accomplished singer, actor, and musician Les Smith, renowned for his authentic portrayal of Garth Brooks. […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"learning institution matching all criteria\",\"time_scope\":\"as of 2023\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"4096\",\"time_metadata\":{}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"81574\",\"time_metadata\":{}},\"d3\":{\"doc_id\":\"71405\",\"time_metadata\":{}},\"d4\":{\"doc_id\":\"80394\",\"time_metadata\":{}},\"d5\":{\"doc_id\":\"41218\",\"time_metadata\":{}}},\"source_span_columns\":[\"id\",\"doc_id\",\"start\",\"end\",\"text\",\"source_role\",\"source_message_indices\"]}"}], "logical_call_index": 23, "response_format": "plain", "input_tokens_local": 11669, "output_token_reserve": 409